    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite hero from the lost history, form a team of up to 10 people, and place them on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes will automatically attack and release skills, you just need to position them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect battlefield drops, spoils of war that have been worn on enemies. If you defeat them, you will receive one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with random affixes, selected and properly matched, can enable heroes to unleash greater combat power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain potions and gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potions have powerful effects that can enhance a hero's combat power, revive them from the brink of death, or increase their lethality. Some potions also have negative effects that may kill your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gems are used to increase the skill level of heroes and can be obtained on advanced battlefields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level gain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes who defeat enemies will receive temporary level gains, and choosing the appropriate gain can significantly enhance their combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, you're ready to enter the battlefield now. The sinking world is waiting for you to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple tower defense game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building a team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite hero from the lost history, form a team of up to 10 people, and place them on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes will automatically attack and release skills, you just need to position them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect battlefield drops, spoils of war that have been worn on enemies. If you defeat them, you will receive one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with random affixes, selected and properly matched, can enable heroes to unleash greater combat power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obtain potions and gems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potions have powerful effects that can enhance a hero's combat power, revive them from the brink of death, or increase their lethality. Some potions also have negative effects that may kill your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gems are used to increase the skill level of heroes and can be obtained on advanced battlefields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level gain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes who defeat enemies will receive temporary level gains, and choosing the appropriate gain can significantly enhance their combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, you're ready to enter the battlefield now. The sinking world is waiting for you to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple tower defense game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your team, collect equipment, potions, gems, choose upgrade rewards, and withstand wave after wave of enemy attacks.",
